_id":{"identifier":"131a6003-f4f3-45da-8b83-8842619b193d","type":"other"},"name":"Ana Salgado","role":["Owner"]},{"contributor_id":{"identifier":"c3ba84bc-837e-455f-853a-f9809cfb1ccf","type":"other"},"name":"Sara Carvalho","role":["Owner"]},{"contributor_id":{"identifier":"1936146b-b3f5-4235-a740-4cad69cef4c4","type":"other"},"name":"Bruno Almeida","role":["Owner"]}],"created":"2022-11-14T12:21:14Z","dataset":[{"dataset_id":{"identifier":"146f149e-5508-4ac6-8a64-84f062383f99","type":"other"},"description":"This dataset includes the outputs of the retro-digitisation process of the Morais Silva dictionary in several formats, along with linked data conversion.<div><br></div><div>Machine-readable dictionary data will be provided in XML-based formats, including a TEI Lex-0 and LMF compatible encoding, and a Ontolex-Lemon conversion in RDF/XML.</div>","distribution":[{"format":["PDF"]},{"format":["XML"]},{},{},{},{},{},{"host":{"pid_system":["doi"]}},{"license":[{"start_date":"2024-02-29"}]}],"keyword":["retro-digitisation","TEI Lex-0","LMF","Ontolex-Lemon","machine-readable dictionaries"],"language":"eng","personal_data":"unknown","sensitive_data":"unknown","title":"Machine-Readable Morais Silva Dictionary Data","type":"Textual"}],"description":"<div>The data management plan for <i>MorDigital - Digitisation of Diccionario da Lingua Portugueza by Ant&#243;nio de Morais Silva</i> (PTDC/LLT-LIN/6841/2020) describes how research data was collected, generated, shared and preserved in the context of the project, following FAIR data principles.</div><div><br></div>The main goal of MorDigital is to encode the selected editions of <i>Diccionario da Lingua Portugueza</i> by Ant&#243;nio de Morais Silva, first published in 1789. The Morais dictionary represents a great legacy, since it marks the beginning of Portuguese dictionaries, having served as a model for all subsequent lexicographic production throughout the 19th and 20th centuries.","dmp_id":{"identifier":"5cb78c34-71c6-4e25-978b-0ad9c105f573","type":"other"},"ethical_issues_exist":"unknown","language":"eng","modified":"2023-06-04T05:31:32Z","project":[{"end":"2023-11-14","funding":[{"funder_id":{"identifier":"bda240c1172d4d67a7f8a1cb03f20773","type":"fundref"},"grant_id":{"identifier":"fct_________::PTDC/LLT-LIN/6841/2020","type":"other"}}],"start":"2022-11-14","title":"MORDigital - Digitisation of Diccionario da Lingua Portugueza by António de Morais Silva"}],"title":"MorDigital Data Management Plan"}}